                                        "sense_id": "74948cbd-f0c5-39a2-9238-21a4b2d78772",
                                        "entry_id": "bee1068d-1dee-3df4-96e9-a1e925c69f69",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pliable material derived from the sap of the rubber tree; a hydrocarbon biopolymer of isoprene."
