                                                "sense_id": "38c98301-7b16-3583-9f8d-4fb0491a6e05",
                                                "text": "I curl his perriwig, paint his cheeks, perfume his breath; I am his froterer or rubber in a hot-house"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
